<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dashboard - Toy Soldiers</title>
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: #0a0a0a; color: #fff; min-height: 100vh; padding: 20px; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; }
    header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px; padding: 20px; background: #1a1a1a; border-radius: 12px; }
    h1 { font-size: 1.8rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent; }
    .user-info { color: #888; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    .btn { padding: 10px 20px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600; display: inline-block; }
    .card { background: #1a1a1a; padding: 30px; border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .card h2 { margin-bottom: 15px; color: #fff; }
    .card p { color: #888; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .actions { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    .btn-secondary { background: #333; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <div>
        <h1>🪖 Dashboard</h1>
        <div class="user-info">Logged in as <%= user.email %></div>
      </div>
      <a href="/auth/logout" class="btn btn-secondary">Logout</a>
    </header>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Welcome to Toy Soldiers</h2>
      <p>This is a demonstration of Twilio SMS verification for KYC compliance.</p>
      <p>Complete your phone verification to proceed with the KYC process.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="/self" class="btn">Verify Phone Number</a>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📋 KYC Requirements</h2>
      <ul style="color: #888; line-height: 1.8; margin-left: 20px;">
        <li>Email verification (✓ Complete)</li>
        <li>Phone number verification (→ Click above)</li>
        <li>Identity verification (Coming soon)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
